---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Manufacturing & OEM/ODM — Progene Bio IVD Factory"
  description="GMP IVD manufacturing in Nanjing — colloidal-gold lateral flow, OEM/ODM private label, QC, batch consistency. Nanjing Progene Biotechnology."
  canonical="/manufacturing/"
>

  <header class="page-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Manufacturing &amp; OEM/ODM</p>
      <h1>GMP IVD Manufacturing in Nanjing</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Vertically integrated rapid-test production — from membrane coating to cassette assembly and packaging.
      </p>
    </div>
    <figure class="page-hero-media">
      <img
        src="/images/company-03.webp"
        width="1400"
        height="1049"
        alt="Nanjing Progene IVD manufacturing production line"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </figure>
  </header>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Vertical Integration</h2>
    <p>
      Progene Bio is a vertically integrated IVD manufacturer — in-house raw materials, membrane
      chromatography, cassette assembly and packaging under a GMP quality system.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>600+ SKUs</strong> across 12 series</li>
      <li><strong>Colloidal-gold lateral flow</strong> platform + fluorescence immunoassay (FIA)</li>
      <li><strong>ISO 13485</strong> medical quality management system</li>
      <li><strong>Batch consistency</strong> — controlled membrane coating for reproducible results</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>OEM / ODM Capabilities</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Private label &amp; custom branding</li>
      <li>Custom analyte panels (e.g., drug-of-abuse cups up to 14 panel)</li>
      <li>Custom packaging, IFU and documentation</li>
      <li>Registration support documents (validation, CE files)</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Manufacturing Process</h2>
    <p>Colloidal-gold lateral-flow production — each step controlled for batch-to-batch consistency.</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Raw materials</strong> — antibodies and membranes qualified before production.</li>
      <li><strong>Membrane preparation</strong> — test/control lines dispensed on nitrocellulose.</li>
      <li><strong>Conjugate preparation</strong> — colloidal gold conjugated to detection antibodies.</li>
      <li><strong>Reagent dispensing &amp; drying</strong> — conjugate and sample pads prepared.</li>
      <li><strong>Strip assembly</strong> — pads laminated onto backing card.</li>
      <li><strong>Cassette assembly</strong> — strips cut and loaded into cassettes/panels.</li>
      <li><strong>Packaging</strong> — sealed pouch with desiccant, kit labeling.</li>
      <li><strong>QC &amp; batch release</strong> — lot-level traceability and validation before release.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Quality Control</h2>
    <p>
      Each batch is validated against reference methods; sensitivity and specificity are documented per
      product line. CE-marked lines support regulated-market registration.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="mt-16">
    <strong>Start an OEM/ODM project →</strong> <a href="/rfq/">Request a quote</a>
  </p>

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "HowTo",
    "name": "Colloidal-gold lateral-flow rapid test manufacturing process",
    "step": [
      { "@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Raw materials", "text": "Antibodies and membranes qualified before production." },
      { "@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Membrane preparation", "text": "Test and control lines dispensed on nitrocellulose." },
      { "@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Conjugate preparation", "text": "Colloidal gold conjugated to detection antibodies." },
      { "@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Reagent dispensing and drying", "text": "Conjugate and sample pads prepared." },
      { "@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Strip assembly", "text": "Pads laminated onto backing card." },
      { "@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Cassette assembly", "text": "Strips cut and loaded into cassettes or panels." },
      { "@type": "HowToStep", "name": "Packaging", "text": "Sealed pouch with desiccant and kit labeling." },
      { "@type": "HowToStep", "name": "QC and batch release", "text": "Lot-level traceability and validation before release." }
    ]
  })} />

</BaseLayout>
